    "text": "An aeroplane is flying in a horizontal direction with a velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math> and at a height of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. When it is vertically below a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> on the ground a food packet is released from it. The packet strikes the ground at point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math> is",
